  "Lab-only model: calibration (temperature, threshold, familiarity cutoff) uses only the held-out half of BRACOL, a different source from most training photos.",
  "Lab-only learning loop: pool and test photos both come from RoCoLe (one region of Ecuador); real farms vary more."
